flowchart TD
    Enabled["Mainline enabled"] --> Tags["Gather eligible tags and branch context"]
    Tags --> Traverse["Traverse commits;<br/>inspect branch points and merges"]
    Traverse --> State["Build commit state;<br/>attach merged histories as child iterations"]
    State --> Calculate["DetermineBaseVersion:<br/>calculate versions from the completed iteration tree"]
    Calculate --> Pre["Enrich version and increment context"]
    Pre --> Rules["Apply matching trunk/non-trunk rules"]
    Rules --> Post["Clean up context after each commit"]
    Post --> Fold["Fold baseline operands<br/>and increment operators"]
    Fold --> Source{"Merge between mainlines with<br/>source contribution enabled?"}
    Source -->|No| Candidate["Mainline candidate enters shared selection"]
    Source -->|Yes| Floor["Compare receiver merge candidate with source version;<br/>keep the higher numeric version and receiver counting anchor"]
    Floor --> Candidate
